{"id":"A1-L105","title":"Like + -ing: production and review","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U07","focus":"Like + -ing — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Like + -ing — produção e revisão","pron":"r americano","verbs":["think"],"pv":[],"expr":["watch TV"],"words":["football","fun","enjoy","hate","love","mind","weekend","cleaning"],"field":"Lugares","genre":"Entrevista","skill":"Leitura","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 105 · Like + -ing: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Like + -ing — produção e revisão.","**Verbos:** think.","**Expressões:** watch TV.","**Pronúncia:** r americano.","**8 palavras novas** (lugares).","**Texto do dia:** entrevista."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo conduzir uma entrevista sobre hobbies e usar think e watch TV."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["football","futebol"],["fun","divertido"],["enjoy","curtir"],["hate","odiar"],["love","amar"],["mind","se importar"],["weekend","fim de semana"],["cleaning","limpeza"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An interview","blocks":[{"type":"iv","intro":"A student talks about weekends.","qa":[["Reporter: What do you like doing?","I like **watching TV**, reading and playing football."],["Reporter: What do you **think** about TV?","I **think** it is fun but I don’t like watching all day."],["Reporter: Do you enjoy cooking?","Yes! I enjoy cooking and eating even more."]],"gloss":[["football","futebol"],["fun","divertido"],["enjoy","curtir"],["weekend","fim de semana"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The student likes watching TV.","ans":"T","why":"watching TV."},{"q":"The student likes watching all day.","ans":"F","why":"don’t like."},{"q":"The student enjoys cooking.","ans":"T","why":"enjoy cooking."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“enjoy” means…","opts":["curtir","evitar","esquecer"],"ans":0,"why":"enjoy."},{"q":"“fun” means…","opts":["divertido","sério","caro"],"ans":0,"why":"fun."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Like / love / enjoy / hate + -ing","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["love","**I love reading.**"],["enjoy","**I enjoy cooking.**"],["don’t mind","**I don’t mind waiting.**"],["hate","**I hate cleaning.**"]],"cap":"Like / love / enjoy / hate + -ing"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Depois de **enjoy**, **hate**, **love**, **don’t mind** use -ing."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I enjoy ___ . (cook)","a":"cooking","why":"-ing."},{"s":"I ___ it is fun. (think)","a":"think","why":"think."},{"s":"I love ___ TV. (watch)","a":"watching","why":"-ing.","say":"watch TV"},{"s":"She hates ___ . (clean)","a":"cleaning","why":"-ing."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["football","futebol"],["fun","divertido"],["enjoy","curtir"],["hate","odiar"],["love","amar"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["enjoy","cooking","I"],"ans":"I enjoy cooking","pt":"Gosto de cozinhar."},{"words":["cleaning","I","hate"],"ans":"I hate cleaning","pt":"Odeio limpar."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"football","pos":"word","pt":"futebol","ex":"Play football.","expt":"Jogue futebol."},{"w":"fun","pos":"word","pt":"divertido","ex":"It is fun.","expt":"É divertido."},{"w":"enjoy","pos":"word","pt":"curtir","ex":"I enjoy it.","expt":"Eu curto."},{"w":"hate","pos":"word","pt":"odiar","ex":"I hate cleaning.","expt":"Odeio limpar."},{"w":"love","pos":"word","pt":"amar","ex":"I love music.","expt":"Amo música."},{"w":"mind","pos":"word","pt":"se importar","ex":"I don’t mind.","expt":"Não me importo."},{"w":"weekend","pos":"word","pt":"fim de semana","ex":"On weekends.","expt":"Nos fins de semana."},{"w":"cleaning","pos":"word","pt":"limpeza","ex":"I hate cleaning.","expt":"Odeio limpar."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**watch TV** — assistir TV"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"think","pt":"achar, pensar","forms":[["I / you / we / they think","I think it is fun."],["he / she / it thinks","She thinks it is good."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Interview","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Interview","lines":[["Reporter","What do you enjoy doing?","O que você gosta de fazer?"],["Student","I enjoy cooking.","Gosto de cozinhar."],["Reporter","Do you hate anything?","Odeia algo?"],["Student","I hate cleaning.","Odeio limpar."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: r americano","items":[{"label":"r americano","note":"O r americano: língua curvada para trás, sem tocar o céu da boca.","words":["red","right","run","read","road","rice"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you love, enjoy and hate.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I love reading. I enjoy cooking. I hate cleaning."},{"q":"Say what you think about TV.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I think TV is fun."},{"q":"Ask: What do you enjoy doing?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"What do you enjoy doing?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences about your weekend hobbies.","model":"I love reading. I enjoy cooking. I like watching TV. I hate cleaning. I don’t mind waiting.","checklist":["Usei **love/enjoy/hate**","Use